    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωρο-φορέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring presents</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					266c
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				14e
			</span></i>, prob. in Epigr. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.209e
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Archimelos</span>); <i>give as
			presents</i> or <i>bribes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					675
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				40.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινά</span>
			<i>present</i> him <i>with gifts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.32
			</span></i>.</div>
